            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought there was a little too much cream cheese going on here, so I only used one eight ounce package and instead of the chili sauce I used a can of chili with beans to give it more flavor. I then placed the mixture in a casserole dish, topped with cheddar cheese and popped it in the microwave. Nice dip!",
